-- Purpose: Handles Camera, Logic, and UI for AfraiC4t ATM with a distinct "Big Ego" personality.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts
-- Dependencies: TweenService, Players, Workspace, ReplicatedStorage, SoundService, UserInputService, ProximityPromptService
-- Public API: None
-- Networking: Invokes WithdrawFunction (Server)
-- Security: Client-side visual only. Actual balance and withdrawal validation MUST be handled on the server.
-- Performance: Dialogue locks prevent UI spam. C-side FindFirstAncestor replaces slow Luau while-loops for UI detection.
-- Notes: ProximityPrompt is located inside the HumanoidRootPart of the NPC model.

